          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>The Coln manual is written in <fr:link href="/forester/" title="Forester" uri="https://coln-project.github.io/forester/" display-uri="forester" type="local">Forester</fr:link>. Forester is a very flexible tool that can be used in many ways. In order for the manual to achieve its goals, it is necessary to put constraints on the use of forester.</html:p>
